    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "victory? what's the point of a victory if there's nothing to go back to? it's just more fighting, more pain, more nothingness. i look at the horizon and i don't see anything different. it just feels like i'm dragging this weight around for no reason anymore. i'm just done.",
